{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-2","name":"プロデューサー","text":"ん？\r\nどうした、甜花","trans":"嗯？\n怎么了，甜花？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6015003070020","name":"甜花","text":"甜花……\r\nこのオーディション、優勝……できるって、思う……？","trans":"我……\n你觉得我……能在这个试镜里夺冠吗……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-4","name":"プロデューサー","text":"………………\r\n……甜花は、どう思う？","trans":"………………\n……甜花自己怎么想？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6015003070040","name":"甜花","text":"──……優勝、したいって……","trans":"——……我说过，想夺冠……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6015003070050","name":"甜花","text":"……できるって、思う……！","trans":"……我觉得，能做到……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-9","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……俺もだ","trans":"……我也是","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6015003070070","name":"甜花","text":"て、甜花……\r\nいってきます……！","trans":"那、甜花……\n我出发了……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-12","name":"プロデューサー","text":"ああ！\r\n頑張ってこい、甜花！","trans":"嗯！\n好好加油，甜花！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}